// ============================================================================
//  mod_locations.zone - menu preview + loading screen materials for every
//  Zombies start location offered by ui_mp/t6/zombie/selectmaplistzombie.lua.
//
//  Stock BO2 only ships menu_/loadscreen_ materials for a handful of survival
//  locations (transit, farm, town, nuked). Every other row in the list menu
//  asked the engine for a material that does not exist, which is what drew the
//  checkerboard. These 30 materials fill in the rest.
//
//  Sources: materials/*.json + images/*.iwi under zone_assets/, taken from
//  BO2-Reimagined (user-approved import). Art is per-map, not per-location -
//  Reimagined reuses the parent map's art the same way.
// ============================================================================
>game,T6

// --- lobby preview images (menu_<map>_zsurvival_<location>) ---
material,menu_zm_transit_zsurvival_diner
material,menu_zm_transit_zsurvival_power
material,menu_zm_transit_zsurvival_tunnel
material,menu_zm_transit_zsurvival_cornfield
material,menu_zm_highrise_zsurvival_shopping_mall
material,menu_zm_highrise_zsurvival_dragon_rooftop
material,menu_zm_highrise_zsurvival_sweatshop
material,menu_zm_buried_zsurvival_street
material,menu_zm_buried_zsurvival_maze
material,menu_zm_prison_zsurvival_cellblock
material,menu_zm_prison_zsurvival_docks
material,menu_zm_tomb_zsurvival_trenches
material,menu_zm_tomb_zsurvival_excavation_site
material,menu_zm_tomb_zsurvival_church
material,menu_zm_tomb_zsurvival_crazy_place

// --- loading screens (loadscreen_<map>_zstandard_<location>) ---
material,loadscreen_zm_transit_zstandard_diner
material,loadscreen_zm_transit_zstandard_power
material,loadscreen_zm_transit_zstandard_tunnel
material,loadscreen_zm_transit_zstandard_cornfield
material,loadscreen_zm_highrise_zstandard_shopping_mall
material,loadscreen_zm_highrise_zstandard_dragon_rooftop
material,loadscreen_zm_highrise_zstandard_sweatshop
material,loadscreen_zm_buried_zstandard_street
material,loadscreen_zm_buried_zstandard_maze
material,loadscreen_zm_prison_zstandard_cellblock
material,loadscreen_zm_prison_zstandard_docks
material,loadscreen_zm_tomb_zstandard_trenches
material,loadscreen_zm_tomb_zstandard_excavation_site
material,loadscreen_zm_tomb_zstandard_church
material,loadscreen_zm_tomb_zstandard_crazy_place

// ============================================================================
//  MODELS THE PORTED LOCATION SCRIPTS SPAWN THAT THEIR MAP DOES NOT SHIP
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  Established by dumping the xmodel list of all 191 fastfiles in zone/all and
//  searching for every model the scripts/zm/locs/*.gsc setmodel or precache.
//
//  The first four DO exist in the stock game, but only inside the per-gametype
//  "so_" fastfiles, which the engine loads according to the gametype being
//  played:
//      p6_zm_buildable_bench_tarp              so_zsurvival_zm_transit,
//                                              so_zencounter_zm_{transit,prison}
//      zm_collision_transit_cornfield_survival so_zsurvival_zm_transit
//      zm_collision_transit_diner_survival     so_zsurvival_zm_transit,
//                                              so_zencounter_zm_transit, zm_transit_dr
//      p6_zm_al_shock_box_on                   so_zclassic_zm_prison,
//                                              so_zencounter_zm_prison
//
//  There is NO so_zsurvival file for prison, buried, highrise or tomb - stock
//  never had survival on those maps - so on Docks, Trenches, Church and
//  Excavation Site these models are simply absent and precaching them is fatal.
//  Pulling them into mod.ff registers them globally, for every map and mode.
//
//  🛑 This also corrects checkpoint 3, which recorded
//  zm_collision_transit_cornfield_survival as "proven absent from the stock
//  zm_transit fastfile" and had Cornfield's boundary wall deleted on that
//  basis. It was never absent - it was in so_zsurvival_zm_transit all along,
//  and the earlier search simply had not looked at the so_ files.
//
//  The last two exist in NO fastfile anywhere: they are models Reimagined
//  authored (a cut-down plywood sheet and a taller fence post) for the Origins
//  Excavation Site wallbuy hoardings. Built here from its GLB exports.
// ============================================================================
xmodel,p6_zm_buildable_bench_tarp
xmodel,p6_zm_al_shock_box_on
xmodel,zm_collision_transit_cornfield_survival
xmodel,zm_collision_transit_diner_survival
xmodel,p6_pak_old_plywood_small
xmodel,p6_zm_tm_wood_post_thin_01_tall
